# Typing in a block when a sync tool changes another line of the file keeps the block in edit mode, so the rest of the words land in the text.
# BUG: a silent reload ends edit mode, so the next typed characters run as navigate commands (here `a s` adds a section "e"); file-io.md §3 keeps focus and zoom but says nothing of edit mode.
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber
Home:
	- Fix the shelf
END
keys j <Enter>
type  now
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber now
Home:
	- Fix the shelf
END
outside <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber now
Home:
	- Fix the big shelf
END
see Fix the big shelf
type  please
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber now please
Home:
	- Fix the big shelf
END
